<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">Jonah</book>
  <para style="h">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jonah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jonah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amittai tapa Jonah kungah Mangpa thu ahing tunga:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Dingdoh inlen, tua khopi lientah Nineveh ah pei inlen, agitlouna uh ka masanga ahing tuntou tah zieh in a tungtang thu uh va tangkoupi in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Jonah adingdoh a, Mangpa mai a kipat in Tarshish lam a taimang dingin akisata hi. Joppa khuo ah apeisuh a, Tarshish zuon ding tembawh khat amu a, tuachi’n atuonman ding apie a, Mangpa mai a kipat a taimang dingin tembawh sungah alut a, Tarshish lam a pei dingte toh in tembawh sungah atuong khawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n tuipi tungah huipi hattah ahing sawl a, tuachi’n tuipi tungah khopihui nasatah alaanga, tuachi’n tembawh sedingin akisata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n tembawhpute azauta ua, tualeh mi chin in ama pasien chiet ahanta uhi, tualeh tembawh azanna dingin a sunga avan puohte uh tuipi ah apaidohta uhi. Hinanleh Jonah khu tembawh sung nuoinung pen ah ana lutsuhta a, alum a nuomtah in ana imu zieu zuou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n tembaw heh lamkaipa akungah ahing pei a, akungah, “Bangchidan a nang nuomtah a imu na hiei? Thou inlen na Pasian han in, Aman eite manthai louna ding ahing ngaituo khamaw diei mah,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n tembaw hehte khat leh khat akihou ua, “Hingpei un, koi zieh a tam buoina itung ua hing tung ahiei mah,” chi itheina dingun aisan vai akichi uhi. Tuabanga ai asan uleh Jonah tungah atuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten Jonah kungah, “Hepitahin hing hil in, Koi zieh a itung ua tambang buoina hing tung ahiei mah? Nang bang nasem na hiei? Hei a hing kipan na hiei? Bang gam mi na hiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama’n akung uah, “Kei Hebru mi ka hia, Mangpa van Pasian tuipi leh leitung siempa giing mi ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n mite azauta mama ua, akungah “Bangzieh a tambang sil na bawl atai?” achi uhi. Aziehpen ahiltah zieh in mite’n Mangpa mai a kipat a taimang ahi chi atheita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah “Eite ding a tuipi kihot asipdide theina dingin nang bang hing law ding kahi uoi?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n akung uah, “Hing dom unlen tuipi ah hing pai un, tuachi’n nou a dingin tuipi adai ding hi. Aziehpen keima zieh a tam khopihui nasatah na tung ua hing laang ahi chi ka thei hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahivang in miten tembaw khu tuipi pieu geilam a hawlkai tum in theitawp suo in apang ua, hinanleh tuipi kihot anasat sem sem zieh in azou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuazieh in Mangpa ahanta ua, “Aw Mangpa hepitahin tam mipa hinna zieh in koute hing mangthaisah sinlen, mawna neilou sisan phuba ka tung uah tusah sin, aziehpen Aw Mangpa, Nang na dei bang banga na bawl ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun Jonah adom ua, tuipi ah apai lutta uhi; tuachi’n tuipi kihot atawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n miten Mangpa agiing mama ta ua, tualeh Mangpa mai ah kithoinate alan ua, thuchiemte abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa’n Jonah val dingin ngapi lientah khat mansain ana koi hi. Tualeh Jonah khu ngapi gil sungah nithum leh zan thum a umta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonah ngapi gilsung a kipat in Mangpa a Pasian kungah thu angen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ama’n ka gimthuohna ziehin Mangpa ka han a, Ama’n ahing dawng hi, Sheol gilsung a pat in ka kikoukhie a, ka aw a naza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Nang tuithuhpi sungah, tuipite sung laikimtah ah na hing pailutta hi, tualeh tuipiten ahing tuom kimvel a, Na ki tuihuolte leh na tui kihotten ahing tum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ken, Na muphahlou ah paimangin ka umta a, hinanleh na biehinn siengthou lam ka enkia ding hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuiten ahing tuom kimvel a, ka hinna nangawn zong tuithuhpiin akimkot a, hampaten ka lutang atuom kimvel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Taang bulte kiphuna dong ah ka peisuh a, Leinuoi leh akotzawlten kumtawn in, ahing khakhum denta ua, Hinanleh Aw Mangpa ka Pasian, Nangman kokhuh akipat ka hinna na domtouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hinna ka sunga aba lai in, Mangpa ka thei ngitnget hi; Ka thungetna na kungah, Na biehinn siengthou ah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pannabei milim ngaisah ten, amauh khotuona ataisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Kenvang lungdam thugenna awging toh, na kungah ka kithoi dinga, Ka thuchiemsa ka tangtung sah ding hi. Hundamna khu Mangpa a ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ngapi kungah thu agena, Ngapi in pieu gei ah Jonah alawkheta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu aniveina Jonah kungah ahing tung kia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Dingdoh inlen tua khopi lientah Nineveh ah va haw inlen, gen ding a thu ka hing pieh va gen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonah akipandoh pai a, Mangpa thu bangin Nineveh khopi ah ava hawta hi. Nineveh khu khopi lientah nithum peina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Jonah ni khat peina chieng, khopi sungah alutta hi. Tuachi’n aman, “Nineveh khopi kisietna ding ni sawm li maimai a um giapta hi,” chiin akikou kawikawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nineveh khopi a miten Pasian agingta ta ua, anngawl ding thu aphuong ua, aneu pen apat alienpen tandong in sai ip puon asilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nineveh leengpa kungah thu ahing tunga, tuachi’n ama zong aleengtouna apat in adingdoh a, aleengpuonsilte asutkhie a, sai ip puon akikhu a, leivui lah ah atousuhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n Nineveh khopi sung pumpi ah amilienten thuphuon abawlsahta a, “Mihing leh ganta hitaleh, bawnghon leh belamhon hitaleh Koiman bangma chiem sih heh, ann zong nesih u’henlen, tui zong dawn sih uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh mihing leh gantate sai ip puon kikhu uhenlen, Mangpa kungah nasatahin kikou uheh; Ahi, michin a umdan hoilou apat hing kihei u’henlen, akhut a um hiemngamna apat hing kinuahei kia heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I manthai louna ding un, Pasian in asiltupte kikhelsah in, alungthahna zauhuoitah apat in alungsim aheimang sih ding chia genthei ding koi ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian in amaute asilbawl hoiloute u’leh a umdan hoiloute ua kipat in akisia ua, alungheita uh chi anasepte uh amu a, Pasian in atung ua bawl dinga agensa silhoilou apat alungsim ahei a, abawl nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh tam thu in Jonah alungkim sah sih mama a, alungthahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa kungah thu angen a, “Mangpa Aw, ka gam a ka um lai a ka gen tami mama hilou ahiei mah? Tuazieh a amasa a Tarshish lam a ka taina tami zieh ma ahi; aziehpen Nang hepisiem leh khotuosiem Pasian lungthah paipailou leh itna adim Pasian na hi a, sietna tunlou dinga lunghei Pasian na hi chi ka hing thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa aw, hepitah in tuin ka hinna la mai in, Kei a dingin hin sangin shi ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n akungah, “Na lungthah khu nanga dingin adihna amah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jonah khopi akipat in apawtkhie a, khopi suolam pang ah atouta hi. Khunah sawlbuh khat alam a, ahim a tou in, tua khopi bang ahing suoh eimah chi’n angah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa Pasian in Jonah in nuomtah a abel thei dingin umgui khat asawlbuh tungah azam sah hi. Tuachi’n Jonah umgui ziehin akipah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh azing ni zingmawng khovah in, tua umgui keitan dingin Pasian in lungnou khat ana guotta a, tua lungnou in umgui apettan a, avuoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahing hi a, ni ahing suohtah in Pasian in suolam hui sa hethut alaangsah a, Jonah lutang nisa in akhaw a, ashibupta hi. Tuachi’n Jonah shi a utzawta a, “Kei dingin hin sangin shi ahoizaw hi, achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian in Jonah kungah; “Umgui tungtanga na lungthah pen bawldih na kisana amah?” achi hi. Ama’n “Dih kisa ma-ing, shi ngap a lungthah ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n, “Na sepgimna leh na kepsa zong hilou, na pousah zong hilou, zan khat kaal thu a hing poudoh tualeh zan khat kaalma a mangkia umgui tungah hepina na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabang ahileh Ke’n Nineveh khopi lientah sunga zietlam leh veilam khen theilou mi tul za leh tul sawmni sanga tamzaw, leh ganta tampi umna, ka lungkhampi sih ding amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
